          "thread": "Institutional DeFi yield products",
          "why": "Apollo's mEVUSD, Zircuit's 8–11% APR platform, and Lombard/Bitwise's Bitcoin yield unlock show institutions demanding DeFi-native returns rather than just regulated custody, a newer and more consequential demand signal."
